<div data-cgap-sector="Waste &amp; Recycling" data-cgap-term="recycling"></div><p class="lead">Waste and recycling sites mix heavy equipment, moving conveyors, the public and loads nobody has looked inside. A tipping floor with a loader backing up, a baler that can restart and a lithium battery hidden in a load of cardboard are everyday hazards here.</p><p>These signs are written for the parts of a site where people get hurt: balers and compactors, MRF sort lines and screens, tipping floors and push walls, scale houses and public drop-off areas, landfill working faces, shredders, collection trucks and containers, and battery and hazardous waste sorting. They are 8x12 aluminum and hold up to dust, washdown and weather.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Balers and compactors</h3><p>Chambers, rams and jam clearing on balers and compactors. 399 signs. Typical spot: On the wire dispenser cage.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-baler-wire-coil-sign-8x12-aluminum">Baler Wire Coil</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-shear-baler-sign-cgap-w17578-812">Shear Baler</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-compactor-pad-curb-sign-cgap-c02601-812">Compactor Pad Curb</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ubc-baler-sign-cgap-n09400-812">UBC Baler</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>MRF sort lines and screens</h3><p>Pre-sort, picking stations, screens and optical sorters. 172 signs. Typical spot: Bag breaker access doors and infeed.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-mrf-bag-breaker-sign-8x12-aluminum">MRF Bag Breaker</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-compost-trommel-sign-cgap-w17638-812">Compost Trommel</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pre-sort-cabin-door-sign-cgap-c01724-812">Pre-Sort Cabin Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-occ-screen-sign-cgap-n02464-812">OCC Screen</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Tipping floors and push walls</h3><p>Loaders, trucks and people on the tipping floor. 47 signs. Typical spot: Push wall face and adjacent columns.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-transfer-station-push-wall-sign-8x12-aluminum">Transfer Station Push Wall</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tipping-floor-push-wall-base-sign-cgap-c01184-812">Tipping Floor Push Wall Base</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-mrf-tipping-floor-sign-cgap-n01049-812">MRF Tipping Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-tipping-floor-sign-cgap-i01319-812">Tipping Floor</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Scale houses and public drop-off</h3><p>Scale houses, customer lanes and public drop-off areas. 35 signs. Typical spot: At the lane entrance and unloading point.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-hhw-drop-off-lane-sign-8x12-aluminum">HHW Drop-Off Lane</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-inbound-truck-scale-deck-sign-cgap-w17591-812">Inbound Truck Scale Deck</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pallet-scale-sign-cgap-c23443-812">Pallet Scale</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-rmw-receiving-scale-sign-cgap-n20645-812">RMW Receiving Scale</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Landfill working face and gas</h3><p>The working face, leachate and landfill gas systems. 299 signs. Typical spot: Fence gates and banks of leachate ponds.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-leachate-pond-sign-8x12-aluminum">Leachate Pond</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-landfill-reverse-spotter-sign-cgap-w13286-812">Landfill Reverse Spotter</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-leachate-blower-room-sign-cgap-c11285-812">Leachate Blower Room</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-leachate-manhole-sign-cgap-n17075-812">Leachate Manhole</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Shredders and grinders</h3><p>Shredders, tub grinders and granulators. 194 signs. Typical spot: Perimeter of the grinder throw zone.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-tub-grinder-thrown-objects-can-kill-sign-8x12-aluminum">Tub Grinder</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-shredder-reject-door-sign-cgap-w04482-812">Shredder Reject Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-shredder-stairs-sign-cgap-c15045-812">Shredder Stairs</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-shredder-shutdown-sign-cgap-n16469-812">Shredder Shutdown</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Battery and hazardous waste sorting</h3><p>Batteries, cylinders and household hazardous waste. 197 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the wall near the scale ramp, so it is seen by anyone working at the battery scale.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/lead-acid-battery-sorting-danger-sign-electrical-shock-hazard-for-battery-charging-stations-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Lead Acid Battery Sorting</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ev-battery-sign-cgap-w17597-812">Ev Battery</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-battery-scale-sign-cgap-c15449-812">Battery Scale</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-mrf-battery-find-log-sign-cgap-n14181-812">MRF Battery Find Log</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Collection trucks and containers</h3><p>Packer trucks, roll-offs, containers and hoppers. 47 signs. Typical spot: On the tilter platform at the control station.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-container-tilter-sign-8x12-aluminum">Container Tilter</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-side-loader-arm-sensor-sign-cgap-w10083-812">Side Loader Arm Sensor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-compactor-cart-tipper-sign-cgap-c08121-812">Compactor Cart Tipper</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-cart-tipper-sign-cgap-n21790-812">Cart Tipper</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs does a baler or compactor need?</summary><p>Typical postings cover lockout before clearing a jam, keeping hands out of the chamber, who is allowed to run it and the restart hazard. Search &quot;baler&quot; or &quot;compactor&quot; to see every option by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for scale houses and public drop-off areas?</summary><p>Yes, including scale house, customer lane and keep clear of equipment signs. Search &quot;scale house&quot; or &quot;drop-off&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Do you make signs for battery sorting and hazardous waste?</summary><p>Yes. Lead Acid Battery Sorting is one of the most ordered signs in this industry, and there are signs for lithium batteries, cylinders and other loads that should never go in a compactor. Search &quot;battery sorting&quot;.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs does a baler or compactor need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings cover lockout before clearing a jam, keeping 